config CORNE_LAYER_TELEMETRY
    bool "Corne active-layer GATT telemetry"
    depends on BOARD_BLECORNE_LEFT && ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL && ZMK_BLE
    help
      Expose the three compiled layers as an encrypted read/notify bitmask.
      This service is only built for the Bluetooth Corne left central.
